    "quickSummary": "In 2026, Poshmark operates a straightforward two-tier fee model: a flat $2.95 fee on all orders under $15.00, and a flat 20.0% commission on orders $15.00 and above. Poshmark does not charge separate listing fees, payment processing cuts, or monthly subscriptions. When sending an Offer to Likers (OTL), sellers are required to discount the item by at least 10% and subsidize buyer shipping ($2.02 for the $5.95 promo or $7.97 for free shipping). On bundle sales, Poshmark charges 20% on the combined total, and orders up to 5.0 lbs ship under a single flat USPS Priority Mail label.",
