    "contentHtml": "\n    <section id=\"executive-summary\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">1. Executive Summary: The Four Cumulative Layers of Etsy Fees</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        Etsy is the dominant global marketplace for vintage crafts, handmade goods, and digital printables. However, new sellers are consistently shocked when their month-end payout statement reveals that between <strong>12% and 27% of their total revenue</strong> has disappeared into platform deductions.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        This margin erosion occurs because Etsy does not charge a single flat commission. Instead, it stacks <strong>four separate fee layers</strong>: a $0.20 listing fee, a 6.5% transaction cut on both item price and shipping, a 3% + $0.25 payment processing charge, and an optional (or mandatory) 12% to 15% fee for Google/Bing Offsite Ads.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        You can simulate your shop exact net payout and advertising exposure on our interactive <a href=\"/etsy-seller-fee-and-profit-calculator\" class=\"text-emerald-700 font-bold underline hover:text-emerald-800\">Etsy Seller Fee and Profit Calculator</a>.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\">\n      <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579621970563-ebec7560ff3e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"Handmade artisan workshop with packaged e-commerce products ready for shipping\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <figcaption class=\"p-3 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono text-center border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Figure 1: Etsy fee stacking: Listing fees, 6.5% transaction cuts on shipping, and payment gateway costs accumulate to over 14% on typical handmade items.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <section id=\"listing-mechanics\" class=\"space-y-4 pt-6\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">2. The $0.20 Listing Fee &amp; The 4-Month Auto-Renewal Cycle</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        Every product listing on Etsy incurs a flat <strong>$0.20 USD listing fee</strong>. This fee is valid for exactly 4 months or until the item sells. Crucially, if you list an item with a quantity of 10, you are charged $0.20 initially. Each time one unit sells, Etsy automatically renews the listing and charges an additional $0.20 auto-renewal fee.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"transaction-cut\" class=\"space-y-4 pt-6\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">3. The 6.5% Transaction Fee on Item Price and Shipping</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        Etsy charges a <strong>6.5% transaction fee</strong>. In the past, sellers attempted to bypass transaction fees by listing items for $1.00 and charging $40.00 for shipping. To prevent this loophole, Etsy permanently updated its policy to assess the 6.5% cut on the <strong>total order value including shipping charges and gift wrapping</strong>.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\">\n      <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559526324-4b87b5e36e44?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"Financial growth graph showing sales profit and cost deduction breakdown\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <figcaption class=\"p-3 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono text-center border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Figure 2: Offsite ads impact: When an order is attributed to an external Google or Meta ad placed by Etsy, total fees spike from 10.5% up to 25.5%.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <section id=\"offsite-ads-tax\" class=\"space-y-4 pt-6\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">5. The Mandatory 12% to 15% Offsite Ads Tax</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        Etsy purchases Google Shopping, Bing, and Facebook ads on behalf of sellers. If a buyer clicks an external ad and purchases from your shop within 30 days, Etsy charges an <strong>Offsite Ads fee</strong>:\n      </p>\n      <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200\">\n        <li><strong>Under $10,000 trailing 365-day sales:</strong> 15% fee per attributed order (Optional - you can opt out).</li>\n        <li><strong>Over $10,000 trailing 365-day sales:</strong> 12% fee per attributed order (Mandatory for the life of the shop - cannot be disabled).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"fee-matrix\" class=\"space-y-4 pt-6\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">6. Complete Etsy Fee Deduction Matrix on $10 to $250 Orders</h2>\n      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white my-4 shadow-sm\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n          <thead class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-mono\">\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">Item Price + Shipping</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">Listing ($0.20)</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">6.5% Transaction</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">Etsy Payments (3%+$0.25)</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">Standard Net Payout</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">Net with Offsite Ads (15%)</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-medium\">\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">$10.00</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$0.20</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$0.65</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$0.55</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$8.60 (86%)</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 text-red-600 font-bold\">$7.10 (71%)</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">$35.00</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$0.20</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$2.28</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$1.30</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$31.22 (89%)</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 text-red-600 font-bold\">$25.97 (74%)</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"bg-emerald-50/40\">\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">$75.00</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$0.20</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono font-bold\">$4.88</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono font-bold\">$2.50</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$67.42 (90%)</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 text-red-600 font-bold\">$56.17 (75%)</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">$150.00</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$0.20</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$9.75</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono\">$4.75</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$135.30 (90%)</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 text-red-600 font-bold\">$112.80 (75%)</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  ",
