    "contentHtml": "\n    <section id=\"executive-summary\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">1. Executive Summary: Domestic and Global Fee Showdown</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        Stripe and PayPal are the twin pillars of internet commerce, processing trillions of dollars in software-as-a-service (SaaS), digital products, and e-commerce volume. While merchants often view them as interchangeable, their fee structures diverge radically when accepting payments from overseas customers.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        For US domestic payments, Stripe charges <strong>2.9% + $0.30</strong> while standard PayPal checkout costs <strong>3.49% + $0.49</strong> (17% higher). For international cross-border transactions, Stripe adds a transparent 1.5% assessment plus a 1.0% FX fee (totaling 4.4% + $0.30). In contrast, PayPal applies a 1.50% international fee stacked on top of an aggressive <strong>3.0% to 4.0% foreign exchange spread</strong>, making PayPal up to twice as expensive for international trade.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        Compare your cross-border processing costs with our live <a href=\"/stripe-vs-paypal-international-fee-calculator\" class=\"text-emerald-700 font-bold underline hover:text-emerald-800\">Stripe vs PayPal International Fee Calculator</a>.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\">\n      <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563013544-824ae1b704d3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"Credit card terminal and contactless mobile payment integration\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <figcaption class=\"p-3 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono text-center border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Figure 1: Payment gateway mechanics: Domestic card processing costs 2.9%+$0.30 on Stripe versus 3.49%+$0.49 on PayPal Commerce.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <section id=\"cross-border-assessments\" class=\"space-y-4 pt-6\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">3. Cross-Border Surcharges on International Cards</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base\">\n        When an American or European customer uses an international card issued outside your merchant country, Visa and Mastercard levy inter-regional interchange assessments:\n      </p>\n      <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200\">\n        <li><strong>Stripe Cross-Border:</strong> Adds +1.5% for international cards. If currency conversion is required, an additional +1.0% fee applies. Total effective rate: <strong>4.4% + $0.30</strong>.</li>\n        <li><strong>PayPal Cross-Border:</strong> Adds +1.50% for international cards. Currency conversion adds an internal markup of <strong>3.0% to 4.0%</strong>. Total effective rate: <strong>up to 7.99% + $0.49</strong>!</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <figure class=\"my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm\">\n      <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526304640581-d334cdbbf45e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"Global currency exchange cash notes and financial foreign trade calculations\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <figcaption class=\"p-3 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono text-center border-t border-slate-100\">\n        Figure 2: Hidden currency conversion spread: PayPal daily exchange rate includes an unadvertised 3.5% markup above the wholesale interbank rate.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <section id=\"head-to-head-table\" class=\"space-y-4 pt-6\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">5. Direct Cost Comparison on $100, $500, and $2,500 Transactions</h2>\n      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white my-4 shadow-sm\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n          <thead class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-mono\">\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">Transaction Amount</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">Stripe Domestic (2.9%+$0.30)</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">PayPal Domestic (3.49%+$0.49)</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">Stripe International (4.4%+$0.30)</th>\n              <th class=\"p-3\">PayPal International (6.99%+$0.49)</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-medium\">\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">$100.00</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$3.20</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-red-600\">$3.98</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$4.70</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-red-600\">$7.48</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">$500.00</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$14.80</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-red-600\">$17.94</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$22.30</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-red-600\">$35.44</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"bg-emerald-50/40\">\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">$2,500.00</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$72.80</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-red-600\">$87.74</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold\">$110.30</td>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-mono text-red-600 font-bold\">$175.24 (+$64.94 loss)</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  ",
